2775..2850 Comment "/// Put-get, put-put and get-get together, the laws a state-passing handler"
2851..2927 Comment "/// is checked against (`../specification/state-wp.gandr`). A read of a read"
2928..3006 Comment "/// under a store is a redex of put-get and of get-get, and both reducts store"
3007..3084 Comment "/// the value and continue at it twice. Get-put beside them is refused in the"
3085..3094 Comment "/// twin."
